   - **`server/include/logger.hpp`** (REWRITTEN, now ~264 lines) — the logging facade. Key new content:
     ```cpp
     enum class LogLevel { DEBUG = -1, INFO = 0, WARNING = 1, ERROR = 2, FATAL = 3 };
     bool parseLogLevel(const std::string& str, LogLevel* out);
     bool applyLogLevel(const std::string& level, std::string* error);
     namespace LogModule {
         SERVER, CLIENT, DBUS, WEAK_MGR, TCP_LOSS, TCP_RETRANS, TCP_CONN, TCP_CONNECT,
